  "metaRegistry": "https://w3id.org/ogc/bblocks/meta-register.json",
  "name": "Building Blocks - OSPD Activity Types",
  "abstract": "Activity types used across the OGC Open Science Persistent Demonstrator (OSPD), consolidated under\nstable `https://w3id.org/ogc/ospd/activity-type/` URIs and grouped into families of related types.\n",
  "description": "A root *OSPD Activity type* block, a profile of the Registered Item Model's activity-type block, and one\nsub-block (profile of the root) per family of related activity types. Each family block carries the Turtle\ndefinitions of its activity types as a data resource, which is uploaded to the OSPD Prez instance when\nthe register is built.\n",
  "sparqlEndpoint": "https://defs-hosted.opengis.net/fuseki-ospd/query",
  "modified": "2026-11-24T11:27:46.709547",
